NOTE ON DATA LICENSING

The benchmark cases in this repository are derived from the Kromp et al. (2023)
human blastocyst dataset, which is distributed under CC BY 4.0
(https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.20123153.v3). Embryo images and the real
clinical fields taken from that dataset remain under CC BY 4.0 and must be
attributed to the original authors. Code in this repository is Apache 2.0.
Generated (synthetic) patient-context fields are released under CC BY 4.0.
